\section{Evaluation}
\subsection{Efficiency and Response Time}
The aggregate benchmark reports 18 minutes for five applications and a 60\% reduction, implying a 45-minute baseline. A 2.1\% error rate and 75\% reduction imply an 8.4\% baseline.
